msgid "Syncing was stopped."
msgstr "Se detuvo la sincronización."

#: ink/sync/errors.lua
msgid "Syncing would delete a large part of your notebooks in the cloud, so it stopped before deleting anything."
msgstr "La sincronización eliminaría una gran parte de tus libretas en la nube, así que se detuvo antes de eliminar nada."

#: ink/view/sync.lua
msgid "Syncs just before the reader sleeps, which uses Wi-Fi and battery."
